    Note over Client,Metrics: 📥 High-Performance Vector Insert Workflow (17K vec/s gRPC)

    Client->>+API: POST /collections/{id}/vectors<br/>Batch of 500 vectors
    Note over API: Request validation &<br/>JSON → Proto conversion
    API->>+VOS: insert_vectors_direct()<br/>Direct memtable access (40-60% faster)
    
    VOS->>+CS: get_collection_metadata(id)<br/>Get storage assignment & compression config
    CS-->>-VOS: Collection config + storage locations
    
    VOS->>+Compression: apply_compression()<br/>SDK-driven configuration
    Note over Compression: Unified compression module<br/>ZSTD/LZ4/Snappy selection
    Compression-->>-VOS: Compressed vector batch
    
    par Parallel Write Operations
        VOS->>+WAL: append_batch(vectors)<br/>Durability guarantee
        Note over WAL: Proto serialization<br/>Recovery point creation
        WAL-->>-VOS: WAL position confirmed
    and
        VOS->>+Memtable: insert_batch(vectors)<br/>In-memory buffer
        Note over Memtable: Fast write access<br/>Flush threshold monitoring
        Memtable-->>-VOS: Insert confirmed
    and
        VOS->>Engine: update_indexes_async()<br/>Background index updates
        Note over Engine: HNSW/IVF/LSH indexes<br/>Hardware-accelerated
    end
    
    VOS->>+Metrics: record_insert_metrics()<br/>Performance tracking
    Metrics-->>-VOS: Metrics recorded
    
    alt Flush Threshold Reached
        Note over Memtable,Engine: 🔄 Automatic Flush to Persistent Storage
        Memtable->>+Engine: trigger_flush()<br/>Memory → Disk persistence
        Engine->>Engine: Apply engine-specific compression<br/>Create SST/Parquet files
        Engine->>Engine: Atomic write operation<br/>ACID guarantees
        Engine-->>-Memtable: Flush completed
        Memtable->>Memtable: Clear flushed data<br/>Reclaim memory
    end
    
    VOS-->>-API: Insert batch completed<br/>Performance statistics
    API-->>-Client: Success response<br/>{success: true, count: 500, latency_ms: 2.1}

